ral problems that the Trump stuff is blinding people too. I think it's sort of like the bankruptcy race between Illinois and California. One of them is going over a cliff. I don't know which one, but probably Illinois. But if one part, I could see how in 10 years from now, we still probably have parties called Republican and Democrat, but their coalitions could be wildly",
