    "turn_text": "You know and that's the benefit you get when you have enough Adderall addicted intern monkeys in a libertarian magazine you can really almost do anything, but I Love my friends at reason What I wanted to ask you though was you know, so Hillary Clinton You said she lied to pander to her own base, which is something I am completely open to about Hillary Clinton. But isn't it possible that another motivation is that she is trying to basically troll right-wingers into attacking her? Because in this negative polarization moment, to be attacked by the other side, even when it's completely Fair yep is a badge of honor right because it doesn't matter what you do It just matters that you make the right people angry right it's there On the Libs nonsense.",
