      },
      {
        "text": "Incentives related to congressional pay are not a significant problem.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "People should ideally run for Congress out of desire to return to their home communities.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Longitudinal studies by finance professors show that members of Congress accumulate significantly more wealth during their tenure compared to the average American.",
