    "turn_idx": 279,
    "turn_text": "And I had an absolutely terrifying moment where Zoe found a skunk. And I did not know until this episode, not this episode or the remnant, but this moment at Hillsville, that skunks once they spray, it takes like a week for them to recharge. So this skunk clearly had sprayed somebody else and Zoe kept yelling at the skunk and the skunk kept turning its butt and facing and aiming it in my dog's face. And I'm screaming incredibly loudly at the dog, you know, to get away. But the thing never shot Zoe and I was terrified about having like the Charles Manson bungalow they put me in at Hillsdale. All it needed was a skunk musk soaked dingo. Really bring out the ambrosia of that place. But anyway, I liked it. I thought the cross country thing was fun and kind of cool and I kind of get it. My daughter did well. It was her first time ever running and she kind of came out in the middle of the pack and I think if it had been crazy hot, she might not have finished. A bunch of people didn't finish, which I thought was interesting. The",
